# You run, snatching the pizza away from the two and scurrying away behind a dumpster.
# roro happy
You can hear the two start bickering behind you but you don’t care! You dig into the stale pizza with a satisfied smile on your face. 
As you continue to eat your meal, a heap of dirty newspapers get launched into YOUR dumpster! You look over, appalled, and see an offensive article ripped to shreds. 
# roro thinking
Roro: Hmm, what does this say? 

# NEWSPAPER PUZZLE STARTS HERE 
You start trying to piece together the ripped up newspaper. Curiosity might've killed the cat, but you’re a raccoon!
# roro surprised
Roro: Wow, they are still going at it? How many years have the rats and pigeons been fighting for? I forget. Not my dumpster, not my trash. 
# roro thinking
You continue to put together the article. 
Roro: Hmmm. Problems in the city, what else is new? Just call Mamdani over and he’ll fix it quickly.
# NEWSPAPER PUZZLE ENDS HERE

With the newspaper now finished, you lick your paws clean from the pizza sauce and lift your nose to the sky. 
You sniff the air and GASP, the smell of a lovely apple pie enters your nostrils. 
You follow your nose, deeper into the alleyway, ready to feast on the dessert. But suddenly a loud BANG is heard, followed by a smaller bang. 
You stop midstep and whip my head over to the noise. Your interest is piqued and you immediately change course. 
As you continue deeper into the alleyway, you can pick up pieces of a hushed conversation. 
Macaroon: Are you sure? I don't want to take food away from you...
Xiu: Yes, Macaroon!! I made this for you!
Macaroon: You made it?!
Xiu: I poured my heart and soul into this pie, because [i]you're[/i] the apple of [i]my[/i] eye.
Macaroon: Coo!!!
Macaroon's feathers explode up into her face, prompting her to hide them.
Roro: Woah… This is beautiful! To share food with your mortal enemy under the cover of alleyway darkness!!!!!
You continue to watch their conversation and it’s filled with LOVE.
Macaroon: W-Well, I made you this!
The pigeon thrusts a meticulously beak(?)-crafted flower crown into Xiu's paws.
Xiu: Wow, flowers? 
Roro: How the heck did she find flowers in the concrete jungle?
Macaroon: I scoured every sky, from dusk to dawn, just to find flowers to rival your beaut!
Xiu bashfully starts twirling her tail while looking demure. Her flustered gaze was directed downward, overwhelmed by the display of affection. 
Xiu: Oooooh! 
Roro: Jeez, even my parents weren’t this mushy gushy with each other!
Macaroon and Xiu continue to profess their love to each other as you watch from your super secret hiding place, the disturbed dumpster. 
Roro: Wow... I didn't think such aggressive species were capable of love.
Roro: But today I was proven wrong! I had no idea that THE rat princess Xiu was hiding a forbidden romance like this.
Roro: If other rats or pigeons find out, these two might be in big trouble...
Roro: I MUST PROTECT THEM!! MY OTP MUST SAIL!!!
Xiu and Macaroon make one last loving confession to each other before entering a warm embrace. 
You watch as Macaroon starts flapping her wings and flies away. Xiu then starts to scurry towards the RatLands (aka the tunnels).
Roro: I need to learn more about whatever is going on between these two!
You start to follow Xiu towards the RatLands, determined to learn more about the forbidden romance. Little do you know, you're set to uncover the [b]real[/b] reason behind the Feather-Tail war! 
